  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/846698999/v1.57.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-28T19:42:57Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/releases/tag/v1.57.0"/>
    <title>v1.57.0</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;✨ Features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allowlist: require HTTPS and validate redirects, block on policy failure &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12619&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12619/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12619&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow callers to supply Goose session IDs &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13098&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13098/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13098&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;🐛 Bug Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux window icons restored in desktop app &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13120&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13120/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13120&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OpenRouter: resolve variant suffixes like &lt;code&gt;:free&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;:nitro&lt;/code&gt; to the base model &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12979&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12979/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12979&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use catalog_provider_id for vision lookup on custom providers &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12993&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12993/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12993&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desktop: start the agent only once after a fork &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13139&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13139/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13139&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduler: use recipe settings in scheduled runs &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13138&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13138/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13138&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voice: use system trust for WebSockets &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13075&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13075/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13075&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prompt: surface MiniJinja render errors in custom system prompts &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12794&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12794/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12794&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providers: request summarized thinking from Claude models &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13029&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13029/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13029&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code-mode: keep recipe final_output tool for the model &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13102&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13102/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13102&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CLI: configure unavailable default provider &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13024&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13024/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13024&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Windows build error &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13081&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13081/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13081&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developer: terminate owned shell process trees on cancellation &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12958&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/12958/hovercard&quot;&gt;#12958&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ACP: fail session/prompt when a turn ends on an error &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13043&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13043/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13043&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Databricks: send the system prompt as system on the MLflow chat route &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13057&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/aaif-goose/goose/pull/13057/hovercard&quot;&gt;#13057&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
